.claude
.git
# This package declares "mirador" as a peerDependency (the host app must supply a single shared
# instance) but also as a devDependency (for its own standalone demo). Since it's consumed
# elsewhere via a raw file: link to this checkout (not a published, pruned package), that dev-only
# copy would otherwise shadow the host's "mirador" when this package's own code resolves it,
# splitting Mirador's module-level singletons (e.g. OSDReferences) across two separate instances.
node_modules/mirador
